# The requirements enums are generated: the build hook writes them into
# _build/ and the wheel force-includes them from there. A dev/editable install
# may additionally generate them here in the checkout.
#
# This file has to live in the tier project root, not just at the repo root,
# because hatchling resolves VCS ignores relative to the directory holding
# pyproject.toml. Without it, the checkout copy is packaged by `packages`
# *and* added again by force-include, and the wheel build fails on the
# duplicate archive path.
/simready/foundation/sensors/requirements/
